{"product":{"id":8765304963360,"title":"Juniores Tubular","body_html":"Coppi apocryphally said that age and treachery will defeat youth and skill, but with the Juniores Tubular, youth and skill may have a chance. The Juniores introduces the next generation of champions to the time-tested technology ridden by every previous generation’s heroes: the tubular tire. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Juniores’ construction is similar to the Rally, just sized down for smaller wheels. Its buttery-smooth ride helps neo-pros – who are just learning to read a race – also learn to feel the road in a way traditional clinchers and tubeless tires simply can’t.","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"Road Tire","created_at":"2023-10-09T04:30:49-05:00","handle":"juniores-tubular","updated_at":"2026-10-19T23:44:48-05:00","published_at":"2023-10-09T04:30:49-05:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, EP70, IPP40, Road, Road-Eligible, Sitewide, Tires, Training","variants":[{"id":46921126052128,"product_id":8765304963360,"title":"21-20 \/ Para","price":"66.99","sku":"1111J00921411TG","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"21-20","option2":"Para","option3":null,"created_at":"2023-10-09T04:30:49-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-19T23:44:48-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"641740059806","grams":210,"image_id":43075760849184,"weight":210.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax_code":"","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":46921126084896,"product_id":8765304963360,"title":"21-22 \/ Para","price":"66.99","sku":"1111J20921411TG","position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"21-22","option2":"Para","option3":null,"created_at":"2023-10-09T04:30:49-05:00","updated_at":"2026